{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466730/extras/Armored_Suit_Solgante_Description_1_EN.png?t=1744430410\" />The war may be won, but work continues for Solgante's pilot! Joint training exercises are being held with Tomzon Base, and only Captain Will can show them how it's done by demonstrating the techniques that brought Radulta victory. Through a sequence of training battles, help the other base's soldiers learn how to fight like champions! Alternatively, you can train using your neighbor Naji's home-built simulator, and prove yourself worthy of his admiration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466730/extras/Armored_Suit_Solgante_Description_3_EN.png?t=1744430410\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466730/extras/Armored_Suit_Solgante_Description_01_EN.png?t=1744430410\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466730/extras/Armored_Suit_Solgante_Description_02_EN.png?t=1744430410\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466730/extras/Armored_Suit_Solgante_Description_4_EN.png?t=1744430410\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Meet new characters! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-New sprites for the beautiful Eleanor and the main character! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">-Naji made a new simulator just for you!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3466730?t=1744430410","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3466730?t=1744430410","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3466730/78a101072e77e125dd3d76a61385bf7e78a27575/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744430410","capsule_imagev